### Tithe Philosophy
The Nikola Project is 100% free and open-source. Donations are 100% voluntary.
If you find value and choose to give, 10% of external donations you receive
flows to Heifer International (EIN 35-1019477, 4/4 Charity Navigator stars)
via the `donor.tithe_recipient` setting in `config/settings.yaml.example`.

The bot's own auto-donate feature allocates 1% of realized LIVE-mode profits
to the project's donation address — a separate, configurable mechanism
(`donor.donation_pct`, default 1.0%).
